          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લાખ (lākh) is a tadbhava of Sanskrit lakṣa, \"a mark; a hundred thousand\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati word (CDIAL 10881). Indian numbers count in lakhs and crores."
            }
